  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Lives and Our Future: Comprehensive sexuality education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to changes so that adolecent and young people in Malawi are empowered, educated, healty and resilient and have the capacity to reach their full potential through receiving good quality comprehensive sexuality education (CSE). The project aims at primary education and will focus on competence building for teachers, capasity building for government at all levels, curriculum and policy development and advocasy for CSE in Malawi.</narrative>
  </description>
